# Swapp.ee Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Swapp.ee.

Swapp.ee is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi staking and pool smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Swapp.ee  
Audit type: DeFi staking and pool smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

